sequenceDiagram
    actor Employee
    participant UI as React Chat UI
    participant API as NestJS API
    participant DB as Application DB
    participant HRIS as HRIS DB
    participant Qdrant as Qdrant
    participant AI as OpenAI/Gemini
    participant Realtime as Socket.IO

    Employee->>UI: Sends HR question
    UI->>API: POST chat message
    API->>DB: Store employee message
    API->>API: Resolve identity, role, and tenant scope
    API->>API: Classify message intent

    alt Employee-specific HRIS question
        API->>HRIS: Fetch live employee facts
        HRIS-->>API: Return scoped HRIS records
    else Policy question
        API->>Qdrant: Search scoped document chunks
        Qdrant-->>API: Return relevant policy context
    end

    API->>AI: Generate concise answer from trusted context
    AI-->>API: Return response and usage metadata
    API->>DB: Store assistant message and usage attribution
    API->>Realtime: Emit chat update
    API-->>UI: Return assistant answer
    UI-->>Employee: Display response

